<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIAN TALLINNA KULMHOONE NET PROFIT THREE MLN KROONS.</title>
<headline>ESTONIAN TALLINNA KULMHOONE NET PROFIT THREE MLN KROONS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tallinna Kulmhoone, a cold storage wharehouse, had a five month net profit of three million kroons and its net turnover for the same period was 26.7 million kroons, it said on Friday.  </p>
<p>The company said in a statement that total business income was 28.7 million kroons and its total business costs were 25.2 million kroons.</p>
<p>At the end of May the balance sheet volume of the company was 45.5 million kroons.</p>
<p>-- David Mardiste, Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9201/2 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
